########################################################################################################################
# Help for sound
########################################################################################################################
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
tune [PRESET] : play a short pitched tune through the PC speaker (alias: tune).
                PRESET is one of: success (default), error, fanfare.
                Requires the 'beep' utility (e.g. 'sudo apt install beep' / 'sudo dnf install beep') and PC speaker
                access (pcspkr kernel module + permission). Only audible on the machine nixlper is running on -
                over SSH that is the remote box's speaker, not yours.
                Configurable via nconf: NIXLPER_SOUND_DEFAULT_PRESET (default success).
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
